                    <chunk name="param_input" index="3">
                      <items count="7">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Strength f [MPa] for the interlayer and utilisation checks. Default 0.03 MPa is a cautious PLACEHOLDER for soft printing clay: about half the unconfined compressive strength printing clays show on a pocket penetrometer (0.6-1.3 kg/cm² = 0.06-0.13 MPa, Friedman-Gerlicz et al. 2024), because interfaces fail in shear and tension. Measure your own clay: penetrometer reading [kg/cm²] × 0.098 = MPa, then halve it (docs/VALIDATION.md §2). The Wood preset uses 4 MPa (C24 shear strength). 0 = no strength checks.</item>
